# slidev-theme-${short}

${name} Slidev theme generated by `theme-authoring`.

## Use as a local-directory theme

Copy this directory into your Slidev project root, then in `slides.md` frontmatter:

```yaml
---
theme: ./slidev-theme-${short}
---
```

Works with `npx @slidev/cli`, `npx @slidev/cli build`, and `npx @slidev/cli export --format pdf`.

## Built-in layouts

- `cover` — title slide (`layout: cover`)
- `section` — section divider with brand-inverse background (`layout: section`)
- All standard Slidev layouts (`default`, `two-cols`, `image-right`, etc.) inherit
  the brand styles from `styles/index.css`.

## Regenerate

This theme was generated from a brand spec via `theme-authoring/scripts/new_theme.py`.
Edit the brand spec and re-run the generator — never edit `styles/index.css`
or `package.json` directly.
